_hero", "label": "RPG Hero System (classes, attributes, gear)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_campaign_quests", "label": "Campaign and Daily Quests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_deeper_rts", "label": "Deeper RTS (counters, veterancy, research, General's Powers)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_outposts", "label": "Outposts (territory)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deterministic outposts per ~900 m cell; only ownership + garrison stored."}, {"id": "readme_clash_of_clans_rules", "label": "Clash of Clans Siege Rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_tower_defense", "label": "Tower Defense on Real Map", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L30", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Towers fire when a commander reports position via /api/loc (takeFire); HP regenerates from a stored snapshot."}, {"id": "readme_raider_waves", "label": "Raider Waves", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Generated from a seed and fought by a deterministic simulation the server resolves once and clients animate."}, {"id": "readme_field_armies", "label": "Field Armies / Real-time